{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AT THE FIRST SPARK OF HUMANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the dawn of human history. It is an age when fire has just been discovered, language is beginning to form, and every breath is a struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Primal Survival</strong>, you are not always the hunter; most of the time, you are the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you back roughly 2.5\u20133 million years, into a wild world filled with life from mammoths and crocodiles to birds and small rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, adapt, and experience the era when early humans first discovered fire, tools, and thought itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution begins here. Survival is the first instinct of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILDLIFE &amp; ECOSYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predators stalk, prey flees, and the world breathes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of species coexist within this ecosystem. Some hunt you, others run from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mammoths migrate, crocodiles guard rivers, birds take flight, and rodents scatter in panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature behaves differently; in this world, life and death constantly shift places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIBES AND EARLY SOCIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own tribe or encounter others. Trade, fight, or unite to survive against the harshness of nature. Primitive communication and early belief systems form the foundation of human culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNTING AND TAMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt with primitive weapons, set traps, or drive your prey off cliffs. The ways of survival depend on your creativity. As you endure, your intelligence grows; you discover new recipes, abilities, knowledge, and learn to tame animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEATHER AND TEMPERATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic snowstorms, sandstorms, and heatwaves. Warm yourself by the fire, seek shelter from the rain, and endure the scorching sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open-world map set in prehistoric Africa<br>\u2022 Animal intelligence and a living ecosystem<br>\u2022 Realistic survival systems (hunger, thirst, fatigue, temperature)<br>\u2022 Day/night and weather cycles<br>\u2022 Crafting, building, and shelter systems<br>\u2022 Early tribe interactions and trading<br>\u2022 Primitive language and communication system<br>\u2022 Blood, damage, and wound mechanics<br>\u2022 Evolving intelligence and character progression</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROADMAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtest</strong>: Q4 2025<br><strong>Steam Next Fest Demo</strong>: February 23 \u2013 March 2, 2026<br><strong>Early Access</strong>: Q3\u2013Q4 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620610?t=1771889999","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620610?t=1771889999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/866b416c5936b3ee2c878a1a9190e7f669f34dfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771889999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/866b416c5936b3ee2c878a1a9190e7f669f34dfa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771889999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4340160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/960329b33b6078d75880d74505acb1db.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1560 height=1196 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join Us On Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.mp4?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AT THE FIRST SPARK OF HUMANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the dawn of human history. It is an age when fire has just been discovered, language is beginning to form, and every breath is a struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Primal Survival</strong>, you are not always the hunter; most of the time, you are the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you back roughly 2.5\u20133 million years, into a wild world filled with life from mammoths and crocodiles to birds and small rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, adapt, and experience the era when early humans first discovered fire, tools, and thought itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution begins here. Survival is the first instinct of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILDLIFE &amp; ECOSYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predators stalk, prey flees, and the world breathes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of species coexist within this ecosystem. Some hunt you, others run from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mammoths migrate, crocodiles guard rivers, birds take flight, and rodents scatter in panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature behaves differently; in this world, life and death constantly shift places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIBES AND EARLY SOCIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own tribe or encounter others. Trade, fight, or unite to survive against the harshness of nature. Primitive communication and early belief systems form the foundation of human culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNTING AND TAMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt with primitive weapons, set traps, or drive your prey off cliffs. The ways of survival depend on your creativity. As you endure, your intelligence grows; you discover new recipes, abilities, knowledge, and learn to tame animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.poster.avif?t=1771889999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.webm?t=1771889999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEATHER AND TEMPERATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic snowstorms, sandstorms, and heatwaves. Warm yourself by the fire, seek shelter from the rain, and endure the scorching sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open-world map set in prehistoric Africa<br>\u2022 Animal intelligence and a living ecosystem<br>\u2022 Realistic survival systems (hunger, thirst, fatigue, temperature)<br>\u2022 Day/night and weather cycles<br>\u2022 Crafting, building, and shelter systems<br>\u2022 Early tribe interactions and trading<br>\u2022 Primitive language and communication system<br>\u2022 Blood, damage, and wound mechanics<br>\u2022 Evolving intelligence and character progression</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROADMAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtest</strong>: Q4 2025<br><strong>Steam Next Fest Demo</strong>: February 23 \u2013 March 2, 2026<br><strong>Early Access</strong>: Q3\u2013Q4 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Quantum Box"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/e05f762555f4fc6eb5bc95e43498ffb3ef7592c8/header.jpg?t=1771889999","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.0 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030 / AMD Radeon RX 550 / Intel UHD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA / PulseAudio compatible</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.0 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X or Intel i5 12600k equivalent or greate<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Nvidia RTX 3060 TI or AMD RX 6700 XT or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA / PulseAudio compatible</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620610/1781766262/e4124406209a969e23b38c39afe564a7f0670b86/1761527668/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761849097","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620610/1781766262/e4124406209a969e23b38c39afe564a7f0670b86/1761527668/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761849097","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620610/1781766262/e4124406209a969e23b38c39afe564a7f0670b86/1761527668/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761849097","id":2572